{
 "@language_name": "简体中文",
 "  •  {bullet_text}": "  •  {bullet_text}",
 " across {pages} pages": "，共{pages}页",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Retry</b> — read this same stripe again.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Skip Stripe</b> — leave this stripe unread for now and jump to the next unread one. You can come back to it later in this session.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Save Partial &amp; Quit</b> — stop here and save what you have read so far. Next time you load this chart, <i>Continue Measurement</i> will pick up where you left off.": "&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>重试</b> — 再次读取这一条。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>跳过色条</b> — 暂时不读这一条，跳到下一条未读的。你可以在本次会话中稍后回来读它。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>保存部分并退出</b> — 到此为止，保存目前已读取的内容。下次加载这张色卡时，<i>继续测量</i>会从你停下的地方接着进行。",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;• connected to your Mac via USB<br>": "&nbsp;&nbsp;• 已通过USB连接到你的Mac<br>",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;• connected to your Windows PC via USB<br>": "&nbsp;&nbsp;• 已通过USB连接到你的Windows电脑<br>",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;• switched on<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• not in use by another application<br><br>Once the instrument is ready, press <b>Start Measurement</b> again.": "&nbsp;&nbsp;• 已开机<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 未被其他应用占用<br><br>仪器就绪后，请再次按<b>开始测量</b>。",
 "'{name}' already exists in:\n  {folder}\n\nOverwrite it?": "'{name}' 已存在于:\n  {folder}\n\n要覆盖它吗？",
 "(empty path)": "（路径为空）",
 "(needs 3+ files)": "（需要3个以上文件）",
 "-{flag}": "-{flag}",
 ".ti3 test data file:": ".ti3 测试数据文件:",
 "1 colour from “{name}” is ready to add.": "来自“{name}”的1种颜色已准备好添加。",
 "1 page": "1页",
 "1 patch selected.": "已选中1个色块。",
 "1 spacer selected.": "已选中1个间隔条。",
 "1. Create Chart": "1. 创建色卡",
 "16-bit": "16位",
 "16-bit TIFF": "16位TIFF",
 "2. Print Chart": "2. 打印色卡",
 "3. Measure": "3. 测量",
 "3D difference map": "3D差异图",
 "3D distribution…": "3D分布…",
 "4. Build Profile": "4. 生成配置文件",
 "4. Calibration & Profiling": "4. 校准与配置文件",
 "5. Check & Refine": "5. 检查与优化",
 "8-bit": "8位",
 "<b>-I &nbsp; Embed calibration without applying</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>The .cal is embedded in the .ti2 as metadata only; patch values are left untouched. Use this when your printer or RIP already applies linearisation natively (e.g. EFI Fiery, Wasatch, or any RIP with its own LUT). colprof will reference the .cal when building the profile.</span>": "<b>-I &nbsp; 嵌入校准但不应用</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>.cal 仅作为元数据嵌入 .ti2；色块值保持不变。当你的打印机或RIP本身已应用线性化（如EFI Fiery、Wasatch或任何自带LUT的RIP）时使用。colprof在生成配置文件时会引用该 .cal。</span>",
 "<b>-K &nbsp; Apply calibration to patches</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>printtarg remaps every patch value through the .cal curves before printing. Use this when your printer has no built-in linearisation — the chart will already reflect calibrated device behaviour. Recommended for most desktop inkjet printers driven directly from a TIFF.</span>": "<b>-K &nbsp; 将校准应用到色块</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>printtarg在打印前把每个色块值都通过 .cal 曲线重新映射。当你的打印机没有内置线性化时使用 — 色卡将直接反映校准后的设备行为。推荐用于大多数直接由TIFF驱动的桌面喷墨打印机。</span>",
 "<b>1 strip has at least one patch above ΔE {limit:.1f} and should be re-measured:</b>": "<b>有1条色条至少有一个色块超过ΔE {limit:.1f}，应重新测量:</b>",
 "<b>All stripes have been read successfully.</b><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Build Profile</b> — finalise the measurement and go to the Build Profile tab.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again to average</b> — read the whole chart once more; the reads are averaged together to reduce instrument noise (saved as …_average).<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Re-read Stripes</b> — re-scan individual strips into this same measurement. Use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move, <b>n</b> for the next unread stripe, and <b>d</b> when done.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>After <b>Measure again to average</b> the instrument is set up again — this can take a few seconds and may ask you to recalibrate before the next read starts, so a brief pause here is normal.</span>": "<b>所有色条都已成功读取。</b><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>生成配置文件</b> — 完成测量并前往生成配置文件标签页。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次取平均</b> — 把整张色卡再读一遍；多次读取会被平均，以降低仪器噪声（保存为 …_average）。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>重读色条</b> — 在同一份测量中重新扫描个别色条。用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>选择<b>再测一次取平均</b>后，仪器会重新初始化 — 这可能需要几秒钟，并可能在下次读取开始前要求重新校准，所以这里稍有停顿是正常的。</span>",
 "<b>All stripes have been read successfully.</b><br><br>Click <b>Build Profile</b> to finalise the measurement and go directly to the Build Profile tab — the next and final step.<br><br>If you would like to re-read any stripe first, click <b>Re-read Stripes</b>. Use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move forward and back between stripes, <b>n</b> to jump to the next unread stripe, and press <b>d</b> when you are done.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>These instructions are always visible in the output log below.</span>": "<b>所有色条都已成功读取。</b><br><br>点击<b>生成配置文件</b>完成测量并直接前往生成配置文件标签页 — 这是下一步，也是最后一步。<br><br>如果想先重读某条色条，点击<b>重读色条</b>。用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 在色条间前后移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>这些说明始终显示在下方的输出日志中。</span>",
 "<b>All stripes of your calibration target have been read successfully.</b><br><br>The measurement data has been saved. The next step is to turn it into a <b>calibration file (.cal)</b> — click <b>Create Calibration File</b> to go directly to the <b>4. Calibration &amp; Profiling</b> tab, where the file path is already filled in and ready to go.<br><br>If you would like to re-read any stripe first, click <b>Re-read Stripes</b>. Use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move forward and back between stripes, <b>n</b> to jump to the next unread stripe, and press <b>d</b> when you are done.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>These instructions are always visible in the output log below.</span>": "<b>校准目标的所有色条都已成功读取。</b><br><br>测量数据已保存。下一步是把它变成<b>校准文件（.cal）</b> — 点击<b>创建校准文件</b>直接前往<b>4. 校准与配置文件</b>标签页，那里文件路径已经填好，随时可以开始。<br><br>如果想先重读某条色条，点击<b>重读色条</b>。用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 在色条间前后移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>这些说明始终显示在下方的输出日志中。</span>",
 "<b>All stripes read — {n} reads of this chart are now saved.</b><br><br>Combining repeated reads of the same chart averages out instrument noise and can improve profile accuracy.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Average all reads &amp; build</b> — combine all {n} reads into one measurement, then continue to Build Profile.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again to average</b> — read the whole chart once more and add it to the set.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Use last read only</b> — build from this most recent read and ignore the others.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>After <b>Measure again to average</b> the instrument is set up again — this can take a few seconds and may ask you to recalibrate before the next read starts, so a brief pause here is normal.</span>": "<b>所有色条已读取 — 这张色卡现已保存{n}次读取。</b><br><br>合并同一张色卡的多次读取可以平均掉仪器噪声，提高配置文件精度。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>平均所有读取并生成</b> — 把全部{n}次读取合并为一份测量，然后继续生成配置文件。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次取平均</b> — 把整张色卡再读一遍并加入集合。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>仅用最后一次读取</b> — 用最近这次读取生成，忽略其他读取。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>选择<b>再测一次取平均</b>后，仪器会重新初始化 — 这可能需要几秒钟，并可能在下次读取开始前要求重新校准，所以这里稍有停顿是正常的。</span>",
 "<b>All {n} target strip(s) have been re-measured successfully.</b><br><br>What would you like to do next?<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Build Profile</b> — saves the measurement and takes you straight to the Build Profile tab to create your updated ICC profile.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Continue Measuring Manually</b> — keeps chartread running so you can scan additional strips yourself. You will have <b>full manual control</b>: use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move between strips, <b>n</b> to jump to the next unread one, and <b>d</b> when you are done. The automatic strip navigation is switched off for the rest of this session.": "<b>全部{n}条目标色条都已成功重新测量。</b><br><br>接下来想做什么？<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>生成配置文件</b> — 保存测量并直接带你前往生成配置文件标签页，创建更新后的ICC配置文件。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>继续手动测量</b> — 让chartread继续运行，你可以自己扫描更多色条。你将拥有<b>完全的手动控制</b>: 用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 在色条间移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。本次会话余下时间自动色条导航将关闭。",
 "<b>An unexpected color response was detected (ΔE {delta_e}).</b><br><br>This usually means the instrument was not aligned correctly with the stripe, was moved during the scan, or the wrong stripe was read. A ΔE this high indicates the measured colors are very far from what is expected.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Use Anyway</b> — accept the reading and continue. Only use this if you are sure the scan was correct.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Retry</b> — discard this reading, re-position your instrument carefully on the correct stripe, and try again.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Give Up</b> — stop the measurement without saving.": "<b>检测到异常的颜色响应（ΔE {delta_e}）。</b><br><br>这通常意味着仪器没有正确对准色条、扫描时被移动，或者读错了色条。这么高的ΔE说明测得的颜色与预期相差很远。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>仍然使用</b> — 接受这次读取并继续。只有当你确定扫描没问题时才用。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>重试</b> — 丢弃这次读取，把仪器仔细对准正确的色条，再试一次。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>放弃</b> — 停止测量且不保存。",
 "<b>Apply Calibration</b> — bakes your calibration curves (.cal file) directly into the ICC profile. This means every colour-managed app will automatically apply the calibration without any extra steps. Use this after you have created a calibration file in the <i>Create Calibration File</i> module. The profile path is already pre-filled — just select your .cal file and run.": "<b>应用校准</b> — 把校准曲线（.cal文件）直接写入ICC配置文件。这样每个支持色彩管理的应用都会自动应用校准，无需任何额外步骤。在<i>创建校准文件</i>模块中创建校准文件之后使用。配置文件路径已预先填好 — 只需选择你的 .cal 文件并运行。",
 "<b>ArgyllCMS could not be found on your system.</b><br><br>ChromIQ requires ArgyllCMS to create and measure ICC profiles. It was not detected in any of the usual locations.<br><br><b>To install ArgyllCMS:</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. Download ArgyllCMS from <a href='https://www.argyllcms.com'>argyllcms.com</a><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. Extract the archive and move the folder to <span style='font-family:Menlo, Consolas, \"Courier New\", monospace'>/Applications</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. Restart ChromIQ — it will detect the installation automatically.<br><br>If ArgyllCMS is already installed in a custom location, click <b>Open Preferences</b> to set the path manually.": "<b>在你的系统上找不到ArgyllCMS。</b><br><br>ChromIQ需要ArgyllCMS来创建和测量ICC配置文件。在所有常见位置都没有检测到它。<br><br><b>安装ArgyllCMS:</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 从 <a href='https://www.argyllcms.com'>argyllcms.com</a> 下载ArgyllCMS<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 解压并把文件夹移动到 <span style='font-family:Menlo, Consolas, \"Courier New\", monospace'>/Applications</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 重启ChromIQ — 它会自动检测安装。<br><br>如果ArgyllCMS已安装在自定义位置，点击<b>打开偏好设置</b>手动设置路径。",
 "<b>Calibration applied successfully.</b>": "<b>校准应用成功。</b>",
 "<b>Calibration complete. The app will guide you to each strip.</b><br><br>There are <b>{n} strip(s)</b> to re-measure. The app will automatically navigate chartread to each one — <b>you do not need to press f or b yourself.</b>": "<b>校准完成。应用会引导你到每条色条。</b><br><br>有<b>{n}条色条</b>需要重新测量。应用会自动让chartread逐条导航 — <b>你不需要自己按 f 或 b。</b>",
 "<b>Calibration complete. You are ready to re-measure strips manually.</b><br><br>chartread is resuming from your existing measurement. Re-scan any strip to overwrite it, or scan unread strips to fill them in — follow the steps below to pick which one.": "<b>校准完成。你可以开始手动重新测量色条了。</b><br><br>chartread正从你已有的测量继续。重新扫描任何色条即可覆盖它，或扫描未读的色条来补全 — 按下面的步骤选择目标色条。",
 "<b>Calibration complete. You are ready to start measuring.</b><br><br>Place your instrument at the beginning of the first stripe and trigger it to scan. Then proceed stripe by stripe until all are done.": "<b>校准完成。你可以开始测量了。</b><br><br>把仪器放在第一条色条的起点并触发扫描。然后逐条进行，直到全部完成。",
 "<b>Check Profile Quality</b> — runs a quality check to see how accurately the profile represents your printer's colours. Recommended before using the profile for critical prints.": "<b>检查配置文件质量</b> — 运行质量检查，看配置文件对打印机色彩的还原有多准确。建议在用该配置文件做重要打印之前进行。",
 "<b>First strip: {first}</b> — place your instrument there and scan when ready.": "<b>第一条色条: {first}</b> — 把仪器放在那里，准备好后开始扫描。",
 "<b>Install Profile</b> — copies the calibrated profile to your system's colour profile directory so it is immediately available in colour-managed applications.": "<b>安装配置文件</b> — 把校准后的配置文件复制到系统的色彩配置文件目录，使其立即可用于支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Install Profile</b> — copies the profile to your system's colour profile directory so it is immediately available in colour-managed applications.": "<b>安装配置文件</b> — 把配置文件复制到系统的色彩配置文件目录，使其立即可用于支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Install on this Mac</b> — adds the calibrated profile to your Mac's colour management system so it is immediately available in Photoshop, Lightroom, and other colour-managed apps.": "<b>安装到这台Mac</b> — 把校准后的配置文件加入Mac的色彩管理系统，使其立即可用于Photoshop、Lightroom及其他支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Install on this Mac</b> — adds the profile to your Mac's colour management system so it is immediately available in Photoshop, Lightroom, and other colour-managed apps.": "<b>安装到这台Mac</b> — 把配置文件加入Mac的色彩管理系统，使其立即可用于Photoshop、Lightroom及其他支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Measurement complete — your readings have been saved.</b><br><br>Reading the same chart a second time and averaging the two results reduces instrument noise and can improve profile accuracy.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Continue to Build Profile</b> — use this single measurement as it is.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again to average</b> — read the same chart once more; the results will be averaged together.": "<b>测量完成 — 你的读取结果已保存。</b><br><br>把同一张色卡再读一遍并对两次结果取平均，可以降低仪器噪声、提高配置文件精度。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>继续生成配置文件</b> — 直接使用这一份测量。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次取平均</b> — 把同一张色卡再读一遍；结果将被平均。",
 "<b>Measurement complete — {n} reads of this chart are saved.</b><br><br>Combining repeated reads of the same chart averages out instrument noise and can improve profile accuracy.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Average all reads &amp; build</b> — combine all {n} reads into one measurement, then continue to Build Profile.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Use last read only</b> — build from the most recent read and ignore the others.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again</b> — read the chart once more and add it to the set.": "<b>测量完成 — 这张色卡已保存{n}次读取。</b><br><br>合并同一张色卡的多次读取可以平均掉仪器噪声，提高配置文件精度。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>平均所有读取并生成</b> — 把全部{n}次读取合并为一份测量，然后继续生成配置文件。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>仅用最后一次读取</b> — 用最近这次读取生成，忽略其他读取。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次</b> — 把色卡再读一遍并加入集合。",
 "<b>No measurement instrument was detected.</b><br><br>Please make sure your instrument is:<br>": "<b>未检测到测量仪器。</b><br><br>请确认你的仪器:<br>",
 "<b>Patches with the highest error</b><br>(worst first, ΔE):<pre>{patch_lines}</pre>": "<b>误差最大的色块</b><br>（最差在前，ΔE）:<pre>{patch_lines}</pre>",
 "<b>Place sheet {sheet_n} of {total} on the XY table.</b><br><br>Press <b>Continue</b> when the sheet is positioned, or <b>Give Up</b> to stop without saving.": "<b>把第{sheet_n}页（共{total}页）放到XY平台上。</b><br><br>放好后按<b>继续</b>，或按<b>放弃</b>停止且不保存。",
 "<b>Stop measuring without saving?</b><br><br>Choose <b>Yes</b> to abort, or <b>No</b> to keep measuring.": "<b>停止测量且不保存？</b><br><br>选<b>是</b>中止，或选<b>否</b>继续测量。",
 "<b>Strips with the highest error</b><br>(worst first, avg ΔE):<pre>{strip_lines}</pre>": "<b>误差最大的色条</b><br>（最差在前，平均ΔE）:<pre>{strip_lines}</pre>",
 "<b>The chart is not fully measured yet.</b><br><br>At least one patch is still unread: <b>{patch_info}</b>.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Save Partial</b> — save what's been measured so far. You can resume later by ticking <i>Refine / resume existing measurement (-r)</i>.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Keep Measuring</b> — return to the strip menu and continue.": "<b>色卡尚未全部测完。</b><br><br>至少还有一个色块未读: <b>{patch_info}</b>。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>保存部分</b> — 保存目前已测量的内容。之后勾选<i>优化/恢复已有测量 (-r)</i>即可继续。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>继续测量</b> — 返回色条菜单接着测。",
 "<b>The colorimeter correction file could not be applied.</b><br><br>Argyll reported: <i>{err}</i><br><br>Check the path in <b>Settings → Argyll Options</b>, or remove the CCMX / CCSS reference from the extra-args field and try again.": "<b>无法应用色度计校正文件。</b><br><br>Argyll报告: <i>{err}</i><br><br>请检查<b>设置 → Argyll选项</b>中的路径，或从额外参数栏中移除CCMX / CCSS引用后重试。",
 "<b>The instrument could not be initialised.</b><br><br>Argyll reported: <i>{_b_init_msg}</i><br><br>Try the following:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Unplug and replug the USB cable<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Make sure the instrument is switched on<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Close any other application that might be using it<br><br>Then press <b>Start Measurement</b> again.": "<b>仪器无法初始化。</b><br><br>Argyll报告: <i>{_b_init_msg}</i><br><br>请尝试以下操作:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 拔下并重新插上USB线<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 确认仪器已开机<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 关闭可能占用它的其他应用<br><br>然后再次按<b>开始测量</b>。",
 "<b>The instrument could not be opened — it is already in use by another process.</b><br><br>This usually happens when a previous measurement session was not stopped properly before closing the app. ChromIQ automatically tries to free the device when starting a new measurement.<br><br>Please click OK and then press <b>Start Measurement</b> again.": "<b>无法打开仪器 — 它已被另一个进程占用。</b><br><br>这通常是上一次测量会话在关闭应用前未正常停止造成的。ChromIQ在开始新测量时会自动尝试释放设备。<br><br>请点击「确定」，然后再次按<b>开始测量</b>。",
 "<b>The instrument lost communication with the computer.</b><br><br>Check that the instrument's cable is firmly connected (try a different USB port or cable), make sure no other application is using the device, then reconnect it before retrying.": "<b>仪器与电脑失去通信。</b><br><br>检查仪器线缆是否插牢（换个USB口或线缆试试），确认没有其他应用在使用该设备，然后重新连接再重试。",
 "<b>The instrument refused the requested measurement mode.</b><br><br>Argyll reported: <i>{err}</i><br><br>Check the instrument-specific flags in your settings (high-res, UV mode, scan tolerance, etc.) and try again.": "<b>仪器拒绝了请求的测量模式。</b><br><br>Argyll报告: <i>{err}</i><br><br>请检查设置中仪器相关的选项（高分辨率、UV模式、扫描容差等）后重试。"
}
